        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>第七章读书笔记</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] },\n  svg: { fontCache: 'global' }\n};\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-svg.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n}\nhtml, body {\n  margin: 0;\n  min-height: 100%;\n}\nbody {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: center;\n  align-items: flex-start;\n  background: #d8e8cf;\n  color: #171711;\n  font-family: \"Kaiti SC\", \"STKaiti\", \"KaiTi\", serif;\n}\n.page {\n  position: relative;\n  width: 540px;\n  height: 720px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background:\n    repeating-linear-gradient(25deg, rgba(255,255,255,.12) 0 2px, transparent 2px 8px),\n    repeating-linear-gradient(150deg, rgba(96,140,89,.06) 0 1px, transparent 1px 7px),\n    #d8e8cf;\n}\n.top-strip {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 14px;\n  left: 13px;\n  width: 476px;\n  height: 32px;\n  border-radius: 18px;\n  background:\n    repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(201,194,153,.12) 0 1px, transparent 1px 3px),\n    rgba(255,255,243,.89);\n  box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(87,105,71,.12);\n}\n.chapter {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 26px;\n  left: 384px;\n  z-index: 3;\n  font-size: 15px;\n  letter-spacing: 5px;\n  transform: rotate(-2deg);\n}\n.decor {\n  position: absolute;\n  z-index: 4;\n  background: rgba(218,202,91,.73);\n  box-shadow: inset 0 0 8px rgba(165,148,56,.12);\n}\n.decor.one {\n  top: 26px;\n  left: 441px;\n  width: 41px;\n  height: 27px;\n  border-radius: 55% 42% 55% 45%;\n  transform: rotate(31deg);\n}\n.decor.two {\n  top: 11px;\n  left: 486px;\n  width: 44px;\n  height: 29px;\n  border-radius: 60% 38% 55% 42%;\n  transform: rotate(-22deg);\n}\n.decor.one::after,\n.decor.two::after {\n  content: \"\";\n  position: absolute;\n  left: 9px;\n  top: 14px;\n  width: 27px;\n  height: 1px;\n  background: rgba(154,137,49,.35);\n  transform: rotate(12deg);\n}\n.sheet {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 57px;\n  left: 14px;\n  width: 512px;\n  height: 650px;\n  border: 1px solid rgba(145,155,115,.25);\n  background-color: #fafaf0;\n  background-image:\n    linear-gradient(rgba(179,189,160,.28) 1px, transparent 1px),\n    linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(179,189,160,.28) 1px, transparent 1px);\n  background-size: 18px 18px;\n  box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(76,105,65,.16);\n}\n.sheet::after {\n  content: \"\";\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 0;\n  bottom: 0;\n  left: 126px;\n  width: 1px;\n  background: rgba(131,150,113,.42);\n}\n.sidebar {\n  position: absolute;\n  left: 0;\n  top: 43px;\n  width: 119px;\n  font-size: 11.5px;\n  line-height: 18px;\n  color: #c7343e;\n  transform: rotate(-.4deg);\n}\n.side-note {\n  width: 119px;\n  min-height: 97px;\n  padding: 3px 3px 2px 2px;\n  border: 1.5px solid rgba(203,195,33,.95);\n  background: rgba(255,255,226,.24);\n}\n.side-label {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 319px;\n  left: 22px;\n  min-width: 68px;\n  height: 25px;\n  padding: 3px 8px;\n  border: 1.5px solid rgba(196,193,24,.95);\n  background: rgba(255,255,226,.32);\n  font-size: 12px;\n  color: #c7343e;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n}\n.main {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 1px;\n  left: 128px;\n  width: 376px;\n  font-size: 13.7px;\n  line-height: 18.9px;\n  letter-spacing: .35px;\n  transform: rotate(-.13deg);\n}\n.main p {\n  margin: 0;\n}\n.title-line {\n  height: 23px;\n  padding-left: 1px;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  line-height: 22px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n.highlight {\n  padding: 0 4px 1px 2px;\n  background:\n    linear-gradient(transparent 23%, rgba(239,211,92,.42) 23%, rgba(239,211,92,.42) 86%, transparent 86%);\n  border-radius: 7px 4px 8px 3px;\n}\n.quote-label {\n  padding-left: 12px;\n}\n.para {\n  text-indent: 1em;\n}\n.section {\n  margin-top: 8px;\n}\n.section-title {\n  margin-bottom: 1px;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  line-height: 22px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n.red-underline {\n  border-bottom: 1.5px solid rgba(206,66,65,.78);\n  padding-bottom: 1px;\n}\n.red-circle {\n  display: inline-block;\n  position: relative;\n  padding: 0 4px 0 3px;\n}\n.red-circle::after {\n  content: \"\";\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: -2px -4px -1px -4px;\n  border: 1.5px solid rgba(208,69,65,.83);\n  border-radius: 48% 52% 45% 55%;\n  transform: rotate(3deg);\n}\n.red-small-circle {\n  display: inline-block;\n  position: relative;\n}\n.red-small-circle::after {\n  content: \"\";\n  position: absolute;\n  left: -4px;\n  top: -3px;\n  width: 15px;\n  height: 17px;\n  border: 1.5px solid rgba(208,69,65,.83);\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  transform: rotate(-11deg);\n}\n.gap-small {\n  height: 4px;\n}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"top-strip\"></div>\n  <div class=\"chapter\">第七章</div>\n  <div class=\"decor one\"></div>\n  <div class=\"decor two\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"sheet\">\n    <aside class=\"sidebar\">\n      <div class=\"side-note\">\n        实现自我价值，假自我<br>\n        爱，去主要靠自我<br>\n        爱，而不是为了得到他<br>\n        人的认可来获取价值，<br>\n        主要是喜欢的他人上<br>\n        走，改变他人有用。\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"side-label\">“察觉强”</div>\n    </aside>\n\n    <main class=\"main\">\n      <div class=\"title-line\"><span class=\"highlight\">从这一刻起，就能获得幸福</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"para\">对人而言，最大的不幸就是不喜欢自己。</p>\n      <p class=\"quote-label\">“幸福即贡献感”</p>\n      <p class=\"para\">无论是[illegible]还是存在於这里，都带来“感受”。到自<br>\n      己对他人有用，也就是真贡献感。</p>\n      <p class=\"para\">“我对某团体有益”、“我对他人有用”这种想法足以让人体<br>\n      会到自己的价值。</p>\n      <p class=\"para\">获得贡献感的手段一旦成为了“被他人认可”，最终就不得<br>\n      不按照他人的愿望来过自己的人生。通过认可欲求获得的贡<br>\n      献感没有自由。</p>\n      <p class=\"para\">即使不能真正看寻其他人认可，也可以体会到“我对他人<br>\n      有用”。（主观感觉）</p>\n\n      <section class=\"section\">\n        <div class=\"section-title\"><span class=\"highlight\">追求理想者面前的两条路</span></div>\n        <p class=\"para\"><span class=\"red-circle\">“优越性追求”</span>希望通过努力追求理想状态，以希望得到优秀<br>\n        而得到他人的关注，亦有执着于一些不好的事件时也能得到他<br>\n        人关注，被称为“希望特别差劲”，属<span class=\"red-circle\">“廉价的优越性追<br>\n        求”</span></p>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"section\">\n        <div class=\"section-title\"><span class=\"highlight\">甘于平凡的勇气</span></div>\n        <p class=\"para\">“普通并不等于无能，我们根本没必要特意炫耀自己的优越<br>\n        <span class=\"red-underline\">性。</span>”</p>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"section\">\n        <div class=\"section-title\"><span class=\"highlight\">人生是一连串的刹那</span></div>\n        <p class=\"para\">不要把人生理解成一条线，而是理解成点的连续。</p>\n        <p class=\"para\">人生时速演的刹那，我们只能活在<span class=\"red-underline\">“此时此刻”</span>，我们的<br>\n        人生只存在刹那之中。</p>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"section\">\n        <div class=\"section-title\"><span class=\"highlight\">舞动人生</span></div>\n        <p class=\"para\">跨出家门的那一瞬间“旅行”已经开始，朝着目的地的<br>\n        途途中的每一个瞬间都是旅行。如果因某事而未达到目的<br>\n        地，也并非旅行。</p>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"section\">\n        <div class=\"section-title\"><span class=\"highlight\">最重要的是“此时此刻”</span></div>\n        <p class=\"para\">聚焦“此时此刻”是认真而谨慎地做好现在能做的事情。</p>\n      </section>\n    </main>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>",
